; main.c:3140
MSG_33EE9E1D (871276061//)
Games that need a Kickstart image look for it in Devs:Kickstarts (kick34005.A500 for 1.3, kick40068.A1200 for 3.1). AmigaMCE cannot supply those: they come from your own Amiga's ROM, or from Amiga Forever.
; main.c:3145
MSG_776C7EC6 (2003599046//)
WHDLoad starts games and demos installed to hard disk, as iGame lists them. It is not installed on this Amiga.
; main.c:3147
MSG_13CE4E7E (332287614//)
AmigaMCE can fetch WHDLoad's user package from its author's site, whdload.de (free of charge), and put WHDLoad and its tools in C:.
; main.c:3150
MSG_4EA477C4 (1319401412//)
Unpacking it needs xadmaster.library (Aminet: util/arc/xadmaster000.lha) or LhA in C: (Aminet: util/arc/lha.run). Neither is installed.
